  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_2162.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">El recinto multiusos de Onda ha acogido la noche de este viernes el concierto tributo sinf&oacute;nco a Queen con el coro y la orquesta de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia, reforzada por la Filarm&oacute;nica Mart&iacute;n y Soler de Valencia, con el grupo Dios Salve a la Reina y la soprano Daniella Ratti.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_1896.jpg\" alt=\"img_1896\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_1897.jpg\" alt=\"img_1897\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_1899.jpg\" alt=\"img_1899\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_1901.jpg\" alt=\"img_1901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_1902.jpg\" alt=\"img_1902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_1903.jpg\" alt=\"img_1903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_2024.jpg\" alt=\"img_2024\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/queensimfoniconda280917/img_2025.jpg\" alt=\"img_2025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"